      "weather": "Showers",
      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NORTHERN LIONESS (8) is a first starter from the Ronald Phillips yard by Fernando Bale out of One More Burn. Start all important and will need some luck getting across from the wide draw. Profiles strongly and pay to watch the market closely. ROSA'S PEACHES (1) had been racing in honest fashion recording three placings in a row before finishing fourth (18.59) at this track latest. Better than last start and can bounce back. SPORTSTER (2) turned in a better effort at this track last start, finishing second behind Couragous Lil (18.39) in a Grade 5 /MDN. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings six times from 11 starts. Expected to feature again. CHEERS MICK (6) collected a minor prize last start over this track and distance - must be considered.",
